{%- if rb_part == 'glance' -%}
<p class="lead pdp__glance">Indulge in the pinnacle of gentle elegance. The Duchess blends seductive Jasmine with ultra-delicate Lily of the Valley to condition the most sensitive complexions. Rich in protective flavonoids, this stately bar gently evens out minor discolorations and guards against pollution, leaving a flawless, silky finish fit for royalty.</p>
{%- else -%}
<div class="acc open">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="true">Description<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte">
    <h3>The Science and Targeted Therapeutic Benefits</h3>
    <p>The Duchess is the pinnacle of elegance in the collection, specifically formulated to purify, brighten, and deeply condition delicate or dull skin. The sophisticated pairing of exotic jasmine and gentle lily of the valley delivers an abundance of protective antioxidants while leaving a silky, flawless finish.</p>
    <h3>Key Skin Benefits</h3>
    <ul>
                    <li>Youthful Radiance: Jasmine extract accelerates skin healing and enhances microcirculation, instantly reviving a dull, fatigued complexion</li>
                    <li>Deep Elasticity Conditioning: Active botanicals increase skin elasticity, helping to plump up fine lines and firm the skin's structural matrix</li>
                    <li>Gentle For Sensitive Skin: Lily of the valley provides ultra-gentle non-irritating moisture that soothes and softens easily aggravated skin types</li>
                    <li>Environmental Shielding: Rich in flavonoids, the blend creates a natural defense barrier against urban pollution and free radical damage</li>
                    <li>Tone Equalization: The formula works to gently fade minor discolorations, leaving the skin tone exceptionally uniform and radiant</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>Ideal For:</strong> Sensitive, delicate, or easily aggravated skin.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="acc">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="false">Ingredients<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte"><p>Goats Milk, Mango Butter, Organic Lily of the Valley Oil, Jasmine Oil, Organic Bergamot Oil, Sandalwood Oil, Vetiver Oil, Amber Oil, Organic Grape Seed Oil, Vitamin E Oil, Lily FO, Natural Coloring, and Natural Preservative.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="acc">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="false">The Ritual<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte"><p>Glide over sensitive skin for a non-irritating, ultra-gentle conditioning wash.</p></div>
</div>
{% render 'rb-acc-care' %}
<div class="acc">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="false">Storage / Safety Disclaimer<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte">
    <p><strong>Safety Disclaimer:</strong> For external use only. Avoid direct contact with eyes. In case of contact, rinse thoroughly with water. Discontinue use immediately if irritation, redness, or rash occurs. Consult a healthcare professional if irritation persists. Keep out of reach of children.</p>
    <p><strong>Aromatherapy &amp; Herbal Note:</strong> This product is hand-crafted with active botanicals, natural clays, and pure essential oils. We recommend performing a patch test on a small area of skin before your first full use. If you are pregnant, nursing, or under medical supervision, consult your physician before using bars containing high concentrations of essential oils.</p>
  </div>
</div>
{% render 'rb-acc-shipping' %}
{%- endif -%}
